  "prompt": "Which product sold the most units in each store in 2025, counting all of the product's 2025 units in that store? Use the sales rows whose order_date falls in 2025 (order_date is a UTC day). Keep exactly one product per store. When products of a store tie on units, the lower product_id comes first. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, product_id and units, the product's 2025 units in that store. Return one row for each store with 2025 sales. Any row order is fine.",
